--- !u!114 &2136721134
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2136721132}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9bd95c77f52d02438562392f51a7d25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Mysterious
    portrait: {fileID: 1253943144636767927, guid: 47e86431ddc940c48b4e30e09f584736, type: 3}
    text: "Czeka\u0142em na Ciebie... Nawet nie\u017Ale sobie radzisz. Ale teraz
      wpad\u0142e\u015B w moj\u0105 pu\u0142apk\u0119"
    duration: 7
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 95d320793a9824949a99dd48f2ef01f0, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Ethan
    portrait: {fileID: -8455434932541761271, guid: e5ee4b6f877f73b4999c391fa8f7091d, type: 3}
    text: "Nie rozumiem... czym jeste\u015B? nie jeste\u015B prawdziwy..."
    duration: 4
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7e712ca1c35f6043bd32b3993bd744b, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Mysterious
    portrait: {fileID: 1253943144636767927, guid: 47e86431ddc940c48b4e30e09f584736, type: 3}
    text: "Mo\u017Ce i nie, a mo\u017Ce jednak, w ka\u017Cdym razie bez mojej pomocy
      sobie nie poradzisz. Wi\u0119c... tym miejscem w\u0142ada pewna osoba, kt\xF3ra
      nie lubi gdy mu sie przeszkadza i za\u0142o\u017Cy\u0142 na tym przej\u015Bciu
      blokad\u0119, na wszelki wypadek gdyby uciek\u0142y jego eksperymenty..."
    duration: 19
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e446f2f84daedad4a8dabd7693a95d74, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Ethan
    portrait: {fileID: -8455434932541761271, guid: e5ee4b6f877f73b4999c391fa8f7091d, type: 3}
    text: "Jakie eksperymenty o czym ty m\xF3wisz?"
    duration: 2
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0962695199655954ab891aa44f13257b, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Mysterious
    portrait: {fileID: 1253943144636767927, guid: 47e86431ddc940c48b4e30e09f584736, type: 3}
    text: "Sam sie wkr\xF3tce przekonasz. id\u017A do samego ko\u0144ca i rozwi\u0105\u017C
      zagadk\u0119 z latarniami. powiem ci tylko tyle, \u017Ce s\u0105 one powi\u0105zane
      z flor\u0105 tego miejsca. mam nadziej\u0119 \u017Ce by\u0142e\u015B uwa\u017Cny
      od samego pocz\u0105tku"
    duration: 15
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c1e8ff4a2f70dc45a1d2342d8eab22e, type: 3}
  dialogType: 0
  skippable: 1
  destroyAfter: 1
  skipKey: 32
  blockMovement: 1
  blockAnimation: 1
  blockAttacks: 1
  blockWallSliding: 0
  restoreControlsAfter: 1
  ghost: {fileID: 0}
  player: {fileID: 0}
